.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH prune 1  "prune " 
.SH NAME
prune \- Evict least\-recently\-used entries until the cache fits the given size (e.g. 50MB, 500KB, 2GB)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBprune\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-max\-size\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Evict least\-recently\-used entries until the cache fits the given size (e.g. 50MB, 500KB, 2GB)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-size\fR \fI<MAX_SIZE>\fR
Maximum cache size after pruning
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
